WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
She never snapped at the friend

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.450
who laughed at her in front of 12 people.

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.950
She just stopped replying,

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.150
and 8 months later

5
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.650
she still can't say why.

6
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.450
It was a birthday dinner,

7
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.950
and her friend joked about

8
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.150
her failed job interview.

9
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.250
Everyone laughed, so she laughed too,

10
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.050
gripping her fork under the table.

11
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.150
That night she typed three replies,

12
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.050
deleted all three,

13
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.550
and put her phone face-down.

14
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.350
She wasn't ignoring her friend.

15
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.850
She was ignoring herself.

16
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.550
In week one, she muted the group chat

17
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.350
and told herself it was fine.

18
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.450
By month two, she'd stopped answering

19
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.250
anyone who made her feel small.

20
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.350
By month five, she was saying

21
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.250
"I don't care"

22
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.750
about things she cared about.

23
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.150
By month eight, 40 texts sat unread

24
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.350
and she felt nothing.

25
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.550
Silence isn't peace,

26
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.750
it's an unsent message

27
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.250
that gets heavier every week.

28
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.050
Next time, say it small:

29
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.250
"That one hurt me."

30
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.450
Then breathe.

31
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:50.650
I'm Dimples.

32
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.050
I talk about the things we feel

33
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.550
but never say out loud.

34
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:55.750
Follow for more.
